    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "models/gemini-3-flash-preview"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=={{ \"This businesss specific services: \" + JSON.stringify($json.core_services) + \". Niche: \" + $json.industry_summary + \". For each of these approved keywords, write one blog title and a one-sentence angle that this business could publish to target that keyword.\\n\\nTITLE RULES (follow exactly):\\n- Maximum 60 characters, counted exactly. Titles longer than this must be shortened by cutting words, never by abbreviating or removing spaces.\\n- Use simple, everyday words a general reader would understand immediately. No jargon, no industry buzzwords, no complex vocabulary.\\n- Phrase the title the way a real person would type it into Google when searching for an answer, not like a marketing headline. Favor natural question or how-to phrasing over generic noun phrases. For example, prefer How Often Should You Clean Air Ducts over The Importance of Regular Air Duct Maintenance, and prefer Is a Home Addition Worth It over Exploring the Value of Home Additions.\\n- Make the title specific enough to be genuinely interesting, not vague or generic. Avoid titles that could apply to any business in this industry - anchor it to the specific angle, problem, or decision this keyword implies.\\n- Do not use clickbait tactics like ALL CAPS, excessive punctuation, or vague teasers such as promising shocking or unbelievable information. The title should be honest about what the article delivers while still being specific enough to make someone want to click.\\n- Never repeat the keyword verbatim as the entire title if that would be awkward or robotic sounding. Rephrase it into a natural title while keeping the core search intent obvious.\\n\\nKeywords: \" + JSON.stringify($json.selected.map(k => ({ keyword: k.keyword, category: k.category }))) + \". Return ONLY a JSON array: [{\\\"keyword\\\": \\\"...\\\", \\\"category\\\": \\\"...\\\", \\\"topic\\\": \\\"...\\\", \\\"angle\\\": \\\"...\\\"}]. No other text, no markdown, no code fences.\" }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
