        "jsCode": "// Parse Topics returns one item per topic; send them in one call.\n// The dashboard saves the topics and marks their keywords used.\nconst client = $('Loop Over Clients').first().json;\nconst topics = items\n  .filter(i => i.json.keyword && i.json.topic)\n  .map(i => ({ keyword: i.json.keyword, topic: i.json.topic, category: i.json.category || '', angle: i.json.angle || '' }));\nreturn [{ json: { client_id: client.id, topics } }];"
